CONTRIBUTING

Local RAG accepts contributions under Apache License 2.0. No contributor
license agreement is currently required.

The qualified development platform is 64-bit Windows 10/11 with Python 3.12,
uv, Node.js, pnpm 11.8.0, Docker Desktop, and Ollama.

Before submitting a pull request:

    uv --directory apps/api sync --frozen
    pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
    pnpm validate

Keep changes narrowly scoped, add regression tests for behavior changes, and
state exactly which checks were run. Never submit private documents, filenames,
prompts, answers, credentials, tokens, environment files, private keys, database
dumps, or identifying diagnostics.

By submitting a contribution, you agree that it is licensed under Apache
License 2.0 as described in section 5 of LICENSE.
